{"seq": 11, "timestamp": "2026-07-03T08:31:46.553112+00:00", "elapsed_ms": 12919, "type": "turn_completed", "stop_reason": "completed", "final_content": "当前 workspace 的文件结构如下：\n\n```\nworkspace/\n├── .gitkeep\n├── cron/\n├── notes/\n│   └── trace_demo.md\n├── test/\n│   ├── .gitkeep\n│   └── hello.py\n└── trace_demo/\n    └── run_me.py\n```\n\n**各目录用途说明：**\n\n| 目录/文件 | 用途 |\n|-----------|------|\n| `.gitkeep` | Git 占位文件，用于保留空目录 |\n| `cron/` | 定时任务相关目录（目前为空） |\n| `notes/` | 笔记文档目录，存放 `trace_demo.md` 等说明文件 |\n| `test/` | 测试目录，包含 `hello.py` 测试脚本 |\n| `trace_demo/` | 追踪演示目录，包含 `run_me.py` 演示脚本 |\n\n整体结构简洁，按功能划分：测试代码放 `test/`，文档放 `notes/`，演示代码放 `trace_demo/`，定时任务相关放 `cron/`。", "tools_used": ["list_dir"], "usage": {}, "error": null, "latency_ms": 12919}
